flowchart TD
SimModel["**SimulationModel**<br/>Attributes: BUFFERS MACHINES SIM_TIME WARM_UP Methods: run_replication seed source part_flow returns throughput wip mean_energy_per_part"]
MachineCls["**Machine**<br/>Attributes: name mean_proc availability mttr idle_energy work_energy up resource Methods: failure_process process _run_job"]
BufferCls["**Buffer**<br/>Attributes: name capacity proc_time store Methods: put get_and_process"]
Inputs["**Input Variables**<br/>Buffer capacities integers in {1-10}"]
Objectives["**Objectives**<br/>Minimize wip Maximize throughput represented as negative throughput for minimizer"]
BufferProblem["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>Attributes: buffer_names n_var n_replications base_seed xl xu Methods: _evaluate spawns multiprocessing pool to evaluate individuals and populate objective matrix"]
Multipool["**MultiprocessingPool**<br/>Role: parallel evaluation of individuals across cores Executes EvaluateWorker tasks"]
EvalWorker["**EvaluateWorker**<br/>Function evaluate_single_individual Inputs: candidate capacities n_replications base_seed Actions: set BUFFERS run repeated run_replication collect avg_wip avg_throughput Output: objectives wip and negative_throughput"]
NSGA2Opt["**NSGA2Optimizer**<br/>Attributes: pop_size n_gen sampling crossover mutation algorithm termination Methods: run optimization minimize problem returns result and history"]
Individual["**Individual**<br/>Attributes: genome capacities integers in {1-10} Fitness objectives wip throughput Methods: evaluated via EvaluateWorker"]
Exporter["**ResultsExporter**<br/>Function export_history_to_csv Inputs: optimization result Writes CSV with generation individual_index buffer capacities wip throughput"]

Inputs --> Individual
Individual --> NSGA2Opt
NSGA2Opt --> BufferProblem
Objectives --> BufferProblem
BufferProblem --> Multipool
Multipool --> EvalWorker
EvalWorker --> SimModel
SimModel --> MachineCls
SimModel --> BufferCls
EvalWorker --> BufferProblem
BufferProblem --> NSGA2Opt
NSGA2Opt --> Exporter
Exporter --> SimModel